overning those baskets and the records showing compliance with them.\n\nThe records must be kept for at least five years, with the first two in an easily accessible place. That retention period follows the general 1940 Act books-and-records framework.\n\nI'm working from memory and can't confirm the exact subparagraph numbering or wording as of November 2026. Check the current eCFR text of 17 CFR 270.6c-11 and any later SEC amendments before relying on this for compliance.","ttft_ms":4780,"type":"result","duration_ms":6063,"uuid":"9c5868f4-6739-4d2b-9a10-0d2a638c6c96","ttft_stream_ms":426,"time_to_request_ms":53,"first_content_frame_ms":426,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
